  "entries": [
    {
      "lessonId": "mfg1-mechanical-lesson-008",
      "sourceJapanese": "表示の意味を具体的な行動に結び付ける。\n読めないラベルは使用前に確認する。",
      "sourceHash": "f94c86281caf7f0a0d575355b72ed039040149fc3f2881a4ffd6e1e59f68a870",
      "asset": {
        "assetId": "mfg-royal-week02-mechanical-day08-unreadable-label",
        "assetFile": "assets/manufacturing/royal-weekly-20261107/week02/mechanical-day08-unreadable-label.webp",
        "width": 1536,
        "height": 1024,
        "sha256": "399b83164443498845d42324c43c5813281714f5c95a9ade1d7b9665e529d780",
        "captionSourceHash": "9ffa7fad67cf401a77ba253c29ef2b835413acedc382392c99dfc81fe8f9193f"
      },
      "authoringMode": "PRIVATE_UNREVIEWED_DRAFT_THEN_COMPLETE_CURRENT_CAPTION_MANUAL_CONTEXT_REVIEW"
    },
    {
      "lessonId": "mfg1-mechanical-lesson-009",
      "sourceJapanese": "品質は要求との対応で考える。寸法の合格だけで数量や出荷状態まで合格とは判断しない。",
      "sourceHash": "4e79ef67a3fe430862cf4432ff2ed5b2ecd8a04703ba9d0935a84e6d6c449eb9",
      "asset": {
        "assetId": "mfg-royal-week02-mechanical-day09-shipping-requirements",
        "assetFile": "assets/manufacturing/royal-weekly-20261107/week02/mechanical-day09-shipping-requirements.webp",
        "width": 1536,
        "height": 1024,
        "sha256": "a66c88ad6bfa0de7bd1c44e7b046db03970523d35404650f2b42fc8dda36a933",
        "captionSourceHash": "16ec7fd795820f9afa8d194e8008ccb5b26baebc0f6aad123b996d5eac0129ea"
      },
      "authoringMode": "PRIVATE_UNREVIEWED_DRAFT_THEN_COMPLETE_CURRENT_CAPTION_MANUAL_CONTEXT_REVIEW"
    },
    {
      "lessonId": "mfg1-mechanical-lesson-010",
      "sourceJapanese": "4Mは調査の視点であり、原因を証明するものではない。事実を確認し、対策の効果を継続して見る。",
      "sourceHash": "ecb222cbf972f891a91e32de28cec02fd0abc15c6f8a6e72141f70de20e4674d",
      "asset": {
        "assetId": "mfg-royal-week02-mechanical-day10-4m-investigation",
        "assetFile": "assets/manufacturing/royal-weekly-20261107/week02/mechanical-day10-4m-investigation.webp",
        "width": 1536,
        "height": 1024,
        "sha256": "cbf487a305991e2167e688285ab564c5b508cd3d0b57248b5d42a6a66359a3d8",
        "captionSourceHash": "7c76c19e8321bdff484dd99529ae4ff981dedefc6e92ed017317a424ffb1d0f5"
      },
      "authoringMode": "PRIVATE_UNREVIEWED_DRAFT_THEN_COMPLETE_CURRENT_CAPTION_MANUAL_CONTEXT_REVIEW"
    },
    {
      "lessonId": "mfg1-mechanical-lesson-012",
      "sourceJapanese": "図の種類を調べたい目的で選ぶ。累積比率、因果関係、管理限界の意味を混同しない。",
      "sourceHash": "a5d4b0e59956b0f039f65bff4cbbd18ff5226fabf1b779acf75d49a72e8a20d8",
      "asset": {
        "assetId": "mfg40-mechanical-day-012",
        "assetFile": "assets/manufacturing/daily40/mechanical/day-012.png",
        "width": 1400,
        "height": 900,
        "sha256": "23d1d0bdca7e9922daa2d6adb3bec7a4131d9bfc6265883f884002f28300bd57",
        "captionSourceHash": "cdceb1f2cc0014c372b505f1563699090c2f91e0748bd2246e710cdc86eaacb7"
      },
      "authoringMode": "PRIVATE_UNREVIEWED_DRAFT_THEN_COMPLETE_CURRENT_CAPTION_MANUAL_CONTEXT_REVIEW"
    },
    {
      "lessonId": "mfg1-mechanical-lesson-013",
      "sourceJapanese": "単位を含めて数値を読む。換算は元の量に戻して検算し、質量と力を混同しない。",
      "sourceHash": "08cbdd5a897752800177bb3bacbb13be2643f58b7aa40aa6d646b189c37e8608",
      "asset": {
        "assetId": "mfg40-mechanical-day-013",
        "assetFile": "assets/manufacturing/daily40/mechanical/day-013.png",
        "width": 1400,
        "height": 900,
        "sha256": "82d215605ad295b3ac9c8835affe304c799907abfd9e671d0e0642844b4a0a58",
        "captionSourceHash": "8b22ee7528eb38edec31a99bf241d26ee10d8004452b3f106447fac97f1d9501"
      },
      "authoringMode": "PRIVATE_UNREVIEWED_DRAFT_THEN_COMPLETE_CURRENT_CAPTION_MANUAL_CONTEXT_REVIEW"
    },
    {
      "lessonId": "mfg1-mechanical-lesson-014",
      "sourceJapanese": "割合は分母と対象を明示する。サンプルの比率だけで未検査品の状態やロット合否を断定しない。",
      "sourceHash": "85a6746f35d720c9df6341d0dc10f9885ddf0109d44a8376a0b1e4f8e6de95c7",
      "asset": {
        "assetId": "mfg40-mechanical-day-014",
        "assetFile": "assets/manufacturing/daily40/mechanical/day-014.png",
        "width": 1400,
        "height": 900,
        "sha256": "ee0fdadb272565389e8702d8e591a10443b017b0d0c8e0ba20e332f0b5c6b0a0",
        "captionSourceHash": "4618279e632c5a5635c7ec170d003ebac38efed6eabea2c9ed0ee925641977da"
      },
      "authoringMode": "PRIVATE_UNREVIEWED_DRAFT_THEN_COMPLETE_CURRENT_CAPTION_MANUAL_CONTEXT_REVIEW"
    },
    {
      "lessonId": "mfg1-electrical-l008",
      "sourceJapanese": "検査項目の合格を互いに代用しない。\n現品の識別と事実の記録をそろえる。",
      "sourceHash": "be0b8bf2d02582f4a570aacea9fef592a08465b39b1385e1b4fc99ee0871b2e9",
      "asset": {
        "assetId": "mfg-royal-week02-electrical-day08-inspection-hold",
        "assetFile": "assets/manufacturing/royal-weekly-20261107/week02/electrical-day08-inspection-hold.webp",
        "width": 1536,
        "height": 1024,
        "sha256": "8088e3cfe3c44a340a8fe4ca5fb319e294094a2cbba019a5a60fd58291c648d9",
        "captionSourceHash": "a798690ddb6f47aa4513a81a18c9dac0efafabc51bb4e20732e84935fa6e4b35"
      },
      "authoringMode": "PRIVATE_UNREVIEWED_DRAFT_THEN_COMPLETE_CURRENT_CAPTION_MANUAL_CONTEXT_REVIEW"
    },
    {
      "lessonId": "mfg1-electrical-l009",
      "sourceJapanese": "結論と事実を先に伝える。未確認の原因と確認済みの状態を分け、指示を復唱する。",
      "sourceHash": "3960734f6e59070cd5ff0fe7a9eebb09fb759d2ca2a2645d392c236e7554762a",
      "asset": {
        "assetId": "mfg-royal-week02-electrical-day09-shortage-report",
        "assetFile": "assets/manufacturing/royal-weekly-20261107/week02/electrical-day09-shortage-report.webp",
        "width": 1536,
        "height": 1024,
        "sha256": "b99bd78113a558e44d3005eb2b3a54bf9ebbbf02f0f13fa9fa090b1ceed0ef5c",
        "captionSourceHash": "8f9b5ea9465c7f384642e05a2c50a56073628c180e16128dc9ebbb53dd4c0b5c"
      },
      "authoringMode": "PRIVATE_UNREVIEWED_DRAFT_THEN_COMPLETE_CURRENT_CAPTION_MANUAL_CONTEXT_REVIEW"
    },
    {
      "lessonId": "mfg1-electrical-l010",
      "sourceJapanese": "危険は原因と結果をつないで説明する。対策は担当・期限・確認まで具体化し、実施後も見直す。",
      "sourceHash": "311aab37042dbec57ffdb5a2c71adbd096d3bb58de706604e094f2352e726367",
      "asset": {
        "assetId": "mfg-royal-week02-electrical-day10-placement-followup",
        "assetFile": "assets/manufacturing/royal-weekly-20261107/week02/electrical-day10-placement-followup.webp",
        "width": 1536,
        "height": 1024,
        "sha256": "cc2e9da73c561503b91cf7645118d6eac6b4759b4d45314e8691a5982ebd37b4",
        "captionSourceHash": "1bbde5d4c7a763a3a2d0b409fb7a072d67eb7fba0688dbe07098e2625dfe283e"
      },
      "authoringMode": "PRIVATE_UNREVIEWED_DRAFT_THEN_COMPLETE_CURRENT_CAPTION_MANUAL_CONTEXT_REVIEW"
    },
    {
      "lessonId": "mfg1-electrical-l011",
      "sourceJapanese": "平均、ばらつき、規格への適合は別の情報である。分布を見る図と時間変化を見る図を使い分ける。",
      "sourceHash": "7ac97182b7515dae74e6937e1e9cfd82d179c70e14b1d1eec949ea5ab80d3c89",
      "asset": {
        "assetId": "mfg-native-week02-electrical-day11",
        "assetFile": "assets/manufacturing/royal-weekly-20261107/week02/electrical-day11-histogram-control.png",
        "width": 1400,
        "height": 900,
        "sha256": "d082950a5e98d482fc3781f2864e9fae707d38fc8e1169f1d56378d96f8272b8",
        "captionSourceHash": "1e9a034ee0aaf9099b717f1d6ad17db70363e3c60ebc0267ef5693d7c240d66c"
      },
      "authoringMode": "PRIVATE_UNREVIEWED_DRAFT_THEN_COMPLETE_CURRENT_CAPTION_MANUAL_CONTEXT_REVIEW"
    },
    {
      "lessonId": "mfg1-electrical-l012",
      "sourceJapanese": "数え方を統一してからパレート図を作る。件数の多さと危険の重大性を別々に評価する。",
      "sourceHash": "6bf38e20c1e07bb94c4132c8f23e67fb1bad3d4b9455e430e4fb7af1655dc041",
      "asset": {
        "assetId": "mfg-native-week02-electrical-day12",
        "assetFile": "assets/manufacturing/royal-weekly-20261107/week02/electrical-day12-pareto-exact.png",
        "width": 1400,
        "height": 1000,
        "sha256": "31533cd043dd3c6617869db75c0444b3c2a09613da08972f14b4a68582810a8f",
        "captionSourceHash": "bd88e781d483a23e133b5da5f2f49dbdcd98851d3735465d66064e106c81de30"
      },
      "authoringMode": "PRIVATE_UNREVIEWED_DRAFT_THEN_COMPLETE_CURRENT_CAPTION_MANUAL_CONTEXT_REVIEW"
    },
    {
      "lessonId": "mfg1-electrical-l013",
      "sourceJapanese": "尺度は図の表現の比率であり、製品寸法を書き換えない。線種と寸法の基準を合わせて読む。",
      "sourceHash": "61e3e1aa396f6864baab347c846ccec451c6669338ca2240ed4341bcaa9d7ade",
      "asset": {
        "assetId": "mfg40-electrical-day-013",
        "assetFile": "assets/manufacturing/daily40/electrical/electrical-day-013.png",
        "width": 1400,
        "height": 900,
        "sha256": "ccdd4765df29c0b618c9999193b60030e04ea69e5aa4f6914e609d7829aab334",
        "captionSourceHash": "fb39ec9ba1f65690e98c9ee18914d6d4d54bc3d56c5438e91d4eab4bf5725aca"
      },
      "authoringMode": "PRIVATE_UNREVIEWED_DRAFT_THEN_COMPLETE_CURRENT_CAPTION_MANUAL_CONTEXT_REVIEW"
    },
    {
      "lessonId": "mfg1-electrical-l014",
      "sourceJapanese": "配置は場所、接続は電気的関係を示す。図面間は機器記号と端子番号で照合する。",
      "sourceHash": "9990d5682d40bc83845c192ee91e3a53bb1b9d047c76418e2b218339e7733571",
      "asset": {
        "assetId": "mfg40-electrical-day-014",
        "assetFile": "assets/manufacturing/daily40/electrical/electrical-day-014.png",
        "width": 1400,
        "height": 900,
        "sha256": "350136965f405199b97f1b487c9a208304e46285e6d74cbde00aab2923c8ede8",
        "captionSourceHash": "69ac8d3817099c6f5a167adb13913cbe1731ca2b1ce7427c387df40649fea5e0"
      },
      "authoringMode": "PRIVATE_UNREVIEWED_DRAFT_THEN_COMPLETE_CURRENT_CAPTION_MANUAL_CONTEXT_REVIEW"
    },
    {
      "lessonId": "mfg1-surface-lesson-008",
      "sourceJapanese": "前工程の傷を確認してから仕上げる。\n押し付けすぎは熱と形状不良につながる。\n指定条件と観察結果を記録して原因を整理する。",
      "sourceHash": "354e014df8809fb81e0bb21c0fad6a1ac11c2d64e4b0d0f5e07bc061f7b04349",
      "asset": {
        "assetId": "mfg-royal-week02-surface-day08-buff-scratch-review",
        "assetFile": "assets/manufacturing/royal-weekly-20261107/week02/surface-day08-buff-scratch-review.webp",
        "width": 1536,
        "height": 1024,
        "sha256": "b2d3202e4169e3c3c1f9c844c4ca3c1fcd35e274879ad5e4ef1e7d0752037f00",
        "captionSourceHash": "c94cacbe799ab6ef7dff9c1d8d0cf50d746d30c982174b9cb03ebe8638dc3db1"
      },
      "authoringMode": "PRIVATE_UNREVIEWED_DRAFT_THEN_COMPLETE_CURRENT_CAPTION_MANUAL_CONTEXT_REVIEW"
    },
    {
      "lessonId": "mfg1-surface-lesson-009",
      "sourceJapanese": "液温と比重は測定条件をそろえて比較する。\n比重計の温度と読取り条件を確認する。\n濃度換算は対象液に合う表だけを使う。",
      "sourceHash": "0e66f1319d94125711a891eb188acd39c8d30e302878378603cceacb79f871f8",
      "asset": {
        "assetId": "mfg-royal-week02-surface-day09-hydrometer-conditions",
        "assetFile": "assets/manufacturing/royal-weekly-20261107/week02/surface-day09-hydrometer-conditions.webp",
        "width": 1536,
        "height": 1024,
        "sha256": "80f9a7ff252bd89c3570e5cd960b0900cf80abbb0b1ae1f2a55892e941c24185",
        "captionSourceHash": "b378a50879248ce8dd91e30928f34e9ed0b6069550790df342226892e0067b0e"
      },
      "authoringMode": "PRIVATE_UNREVIEWED_DRAFT_THEN_COMPLETE_CURRENT_CAPTION_MANUAL_CONTEXT_REVIEW"
    },
    {
      "lessonId": "mfg1-surface-lesson-010",
      "sourceJapanese": "開始値と終了値の差が滴下量。\n反応式の係数と体積の単位を確認する。\n終点と当量点を区別し、分析条件を記録する。",
      "sourceHash": "5af27b4e06505d5542bfe0003988ef628d1e222886b305c43eed0938cc51007e",
      "asset": {
        "assetId": "mfg-royal-week02-surface-day10-titration-records",
        "assetFile": "assets/manufacturing/royal-weekly-20261107/week02/surface-day10-titration-records.webp",
        "width": 1536,
        "height": 1024,
        "sha256": "23a2123244b5320b6addea569d45a708d84e514fa1e19d9f76452fa0a573bd17",
        "captionSourceHash": "5442f6b3296600e125f4f2b627964a0fde03cf9dc0da3a32df3766b7ed5cc52e"
      },
      "authoringMode": "PRIVATE_UNREVIEWED_DRAFT_THEN_COMPLETE_CURRENT_CAPTION_MANUAL_CONTEXT_REVIEW"
    },
    {
      "lessonId": "mfg1-surface-lesson-012",
      "sourceJapanese": "酸性酸化物は塩基と、塩基性酸化物は酸と反応する。\n両性酸化物は両方と反応する。\n分類名は安全性の保証ではない。",
      "sourceHash": "e5a9a9cbab9721de9b90fd516becdfda25b41dadfe600ec6f9a09c7bd334687c",
      "asset": {
        "assetId": "mfg40-surface-012",
        "assetFile": "assets/manufacturing/daily40/surface/surface-012.png",
        "width": 1400,
        "height": 900,
        "sha256": "f8943303627a0101202ea8ad026f3db7fa60588d90e6e92969b3c4f375334e4e",
        "captionSourceHash": "ae6de77b805c1fa8285e1d461ca949c3e8f97497bd6b9916cb01b4094a36e799"
      },
      "authoringMode": "PRIVATE_UNREVIEWED_DRAFT_THEN_COMPLETE_CURRENT_CAPTION_MANUAL_CONTEXT_REVIEW"
    },
    {
      "lessonId": "mfg1-surface-lesson-013",
      "sourceJapanese": "透明でも溶けた成分は存在する。\n沈殿の外観だけでは成分を決められない。\n分析の目的と生産槽の異常を分けて判断する。",
      "sourceHash": "dfe9d92dafdcd046ed51e8fd2b47ad4f4f63c475a8816f82836bbc03713166b8",
      "asset": {
        "assetId": "mfg40-surface-013",
        "assetFile": "assets/manufacturing/daily40/surface/surface-013.png",
        "width": 1400,
        "height": 900,
        "sha256": "847ecf290cda31eee9b120f0673da90d1f89ac3aa2870c1b4547668d11220c52",
        "captionSourceHash": "95ae29a7f288cf48c464f53b8100affab7981dedfa9e9f483291eb93d3dd0a88"
      },
      "authoringMode": "PRIVATE_UNREVIEWED_DRAFT_THEN_COMPLETE_CURRENT_CAPTION_MANUAL_CONTEXT_REVIEW"
    },
    {
      "lessonId": "mfg1-surface-lesson-014",
      "sourceJapanese": "質量=密度×体積。\n1cm³=1000mm³。\n概算と材料証明・運搬の安全確認は別。",
      "sourceHash": "91d2a2ac2c673a2dd9f791f9bb7f25c50306bb783fdab8a3b4993356e09a1884",
      "asset": {
        "assetId": "mfg40-surface-014",
        "assetFile": "assets/manufacturing/daily40/surface/surface-014.png",
        "width": 1400,
        "height": 900,
        "sha256": "9a800d9463e166f90f65749ebc6024fadfa3ff88b68df71eba2eaf41eb05a47a",
        "captionSourceHash": "84783e5a8d5ea6a13164c9b9c2b1541c2d7487de2ffa638539982140d86dca96"
      },
      "authoringMode": "PRIVATE_UNREVIEWED_DRAFT_THEN_COMPLETE_CURRENT_CAPTION_MANUAL_CONTEXT_REVIEW"
    }
